  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>Casi 500 personas han participado la tarde de este s&aacute;bado en la I marcha solidaria con la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer de Onda, que ha partido y llegado al Pla, a las puertas del Ayuntamiento, tras recorrer 3 kil&oacute;metros.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/05/IMG_7593.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La marcha ha sido organizada por el Club Atletisme Onda, con la colaboraci&oacute;n del Ayuntamiento y la Caja Rural.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7518.jpg\" alt=\"img_7518\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7519.jpg\" alt=\"img_7519\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7520.jpg\" alt=\"img_7520\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7521.jpg\" alt=\"img_7521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7522.jpg\" alt=\"img_7522\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7523.jpg\" alt=\"img_7523\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7524.jpg\" alt=\"img_7524\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccconda/img_7525.jpg\" alt=\"img_7525\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/marchasolidariaaccco